    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>By Rolle&#39;s theorem <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced></math></p>",
